    "overview": "This document records the implemented identity, rather than proposing a new brand. The existing iridescent orb supplies the visual signature. Manrope headings and DM Sans copy sit on translucent, softly shaded surfaces, with muted lavender linking controls to the logo.\n\nThe workspace has both dark and pearl appearances. Login always uses white pearl glass, matching the default workspace appearance; the workspace preserves the user's appearance choice. The centered login composition is specific to that entrance and is recorded in the surface brief, rather than imposed on other screens.",
